','I wish to taste the searing flames of the mountain of fire. To let the molten fires of Blackrock cascade across my being. That essence, that searing heat, it is what I crave.$B$BBael\'Gar resides in the Depths of Blackrock: A being of pure flame, born of the fires of Ragnaros. Slay Bael\'Gar and from his smoldering remains bring for me a piece of his inner fire.$B$BUse the molt on his remains to safely extract the inner flame.$B$BSucceed and be rewarded.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','0','66102','0'),
