','You want a writ? What? Do you expect me to hand you a highly sought after work order just for showing up? I think not, scrub. Crafters from around the world bid for jobs here at the front lines.$B$BIf you want a work order, you\'ll have to show me that you\'re willing to bleed for the cause. Bring me a valor token and we\'ll talk.$B$BAnd there\'s only one way to get your grubby little scrub mitts on those - get to killin\'.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','0','66102','0'),
